+- With history enabled, a client receives one `conversation_list` containing its authenticated user's summaries with ISO-8601 dates ([validated by: answers an enabled list_conversations frame with the authenticated user's ISO summaries](../../src/transport/ws/listSessions.test.ts#L53)).
