+### 4.3 list_sessions
+
+Requests conversation summaries for the authenticated user. The server takes the user id from the connection, never from this frame; extra fields such as `userId` are ignored ([validated by: answers with the authenticated user's summaries and ISO dates](../../src/transport/ws/listSessions.test.ts#L22)).
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "list_sessions",
+  "limit": 50,
+  "before": {"updatedAt": "2026-01-02T00:00:00.000Z", "sessionId": "s1"}
+}
+```
+
+| Field    | Type   | Required | Description                                                               |
+| -------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `type`   | string | Yes      | `"list_sessions"`                                                         |
+| `limit`  | number | No       | An integer page size from 1 through 200.                                  |
+| `before` | object | No       | A cursor with `updatedAt` and `sessionId` from the last summary received. |
